<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Tysan shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Tysan shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of foundation piling concern Tysan Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The company's shares ended HK$0.03 higher at HK$1.82 on Thursday on volume of 11.14 million shares.</p>
<p>Tysan engages in foundation piling business, property development and machinery hiring.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
